<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>QMIK | Создать талон</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="background app-background">
    <header class="topbar-shell">
      <div class="topbar">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
          <span class="brand-logo">ദ്ദി（• ˕ •マ.ᐟ</span>
          <span class="brand-name">QMIK 2.0</span>
        </a>

        <nav class="nav-links">
          <a class="nav-link active" href="/create">Создать талон</a>
          <a class="nav-link" href="/tickets">Талоны</a>
          <form method="post" action="/logout">
            <button class="nav-link logout-button" type="submit">Выйти</button>
          </form>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="page page-narrow">
      <section class="page-heading">
        <div>
          <h1>Создать талон</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="user-chip"><span class="status-dot"></span><%= user.username %></div>
      </section>

      <% if (error) { %><div class="alert error"><%= error %></div><% } %>
      <% if (success) { %>
        <div class="alert success alert-with-link">
          <span><%= success %></span>
          <a href="/tickets">Открыть список</a>
        </div>
      <% } %>

      <form method="post" action="/create" class="content-card ticket-form">
        <div class="form-section">
          <div class="input-group">
            <label for="full_name">ФИО</label>
            <input id="full_name" type="text" name="full_name" required maxlength="150" placeholder="Иванов Иван Иванович" autocomplete="off">
          </div>

          <div class="input-group">
            <label for="phone">Номер телефона</label>
            <input id="phone" type="text" name="phone" required maxlength="30" placeholder="+7 999 123-45-67" autocomplete="off">
          </div>
        </div>

        <button class="primary-button create-button" type="submit">Создать талон</button>
      </form>

      <div class="create-hint">
        Telegram, Мой налог и Яндекс Про отмечаются после создания на странице <a href="/tickets">«Талоны»</a>.
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
